* ECEN 326 Final Project - Optimized CMOS Two-Stage Diff Amp (8 Ohm Load)

* Power Supply
VDD vdd 0 5V

* Signal Source (20mV peak at 10 kHz, 2.5V DC common-mode)
VIN v_plus 0 DC 2.5 AC 1 SIN(2.5 0.02 10k)

* Non-Inverting Closed-Loop Feedback: Av = 1 + (R2/R1) = 1 + (270k/10k) = 28 V/V
R1 v_minus v_dc_block 10k
C_DC v_dc_block 0 100u
R2 v_out v_minus 270k

* Stage 1: CD4007 Matched CMOS Pair & Active Load
M1 v_d1 v_minus v_tail 0 CD4007_NMOS
M2 v_stage1 v_plus v_tail 0 CD4007_NMOS
M3 v_d1 v_d1 vdd vdd CD4007_PMOS
M4 v_stage1 v_d1 vdd vdd CD4007_PMOS

* Tail Current Source
Itail v_tail 0 300u

* Class-AB Bias Level Shifter
V_AB v_stage1 v_gate_pmos DC -0.95

* Stage 2: Power MOSFET Push-Pull Output Buffer (TO-220)
M5 v_out v_gate_pmos vdd vdd FQP27P06
M6 v_out v_stage1 0 0 IRLZ44N

* Miller Frequency Compensation Capacitor
CC v_stage1 v_out 1.2p

* AC Coupled 8-Ohm Load
C_OUT v_out v_load_ac 1000u
RLOAD v_load_ac 0 8

* --- DEVICE MODELS ---
.model CD4007_NMOS NMOS(Level=1 VTO=1.5 KP=0.5m Gamma=0.4 Lambda=0.01)
.model CD4007_PMOS PMOS(Level=1 VTO=-1.5 KP=0.5m Gamma=0.4 Lambda=0.02)
.model IRLZ44N NMOS(Level=3 VTO=1.5 KP=40 CGSO=1700p)
.model FQP27P06 PMOS(Level=3 VTO=-2.5 KP=20 CGSO=1400p)

* --- SIMULATION & EXTRACTION COMMANDS ---
.control
op
let ptot_mw = abs(v(vdd#branch)[0]) * 5.0 * 1000.0
echo MEAS_POWER: "$&ptot_mw"

ac dec 20 100 10MEG
let mag_vout = mag(v(v_load_ac))
meas ac gain10k find mag_vout at=10000
meas ac max_gain max mag_vout
meas ac f3db when mag_vout=0.7071*max_gain fall=1
echo MEAS_GAIN: "$&max_gain"
echo MEAS_F3DB: "$&f3db"

tran 1u 1m
fourier 10k v(v_load_ac)
.endc
.end